Z||000000||Richard Parnell||12-01-1999||02:21 PM||||I don't know if I'll ever get my V8 into my 87 SC.  I have the engine, a '77 350 (new block old was cracked)with a cam for towing, it's out of one of those huge Chevys Caprices or something like that. Now someone told me since it was hooked to an automatic that I'll have to do a bunch of other work to hook it to my 5 speed.  I'm planning on redoing all the suspension and brakes also.  Maybe Batboy could help.  I'm here on Oahu so I can't just drive over to the great Fiero shops.  Wish I could.||||reg||9
